{"uid":"462a38d2b81efe5f","name":"Failed RFC callback for invalid RTP transition - DS-12N RJCR compliant","fullName":"functional-tests.tests.callbacks.test_RTP_callback_DS_12N#test_fail_send_rfc_callback_invalid_transition_DS_12N_RJCR_compliant","historyId":"c8bdabee3ab8bd94d2459130f14443b8","time":{"start":1788416390901,"stop":1788416396062,"duration":5161},"description":"\nTest RFC callback DS12N with RJCR status applied twice on the same RTP.\n\nFlow:\n1. Activate payer\n2. Send an RTP via GPD message (CREATE VALID)\n3. Cancel the RTP via GPD message (DELETE) -> RTP to RFC_SENT\n4. Send DS12N callback with CxlStsId RJCR (Rejected Cancellation Request) -> RTP to ERROR_CANCEL\n5. Send the same DS12N RJCR callback again on the already transitioned RTP\n6. Verify the second callback is rejected (400) since the transition is no longer valid\n7. Verify RTP status remains ERROR_CANCEL\n","descriptionHtml":"<p>Test RFC callback DS12N with RJCR status applied twice on the same RTP.</p>\n<p>Flow:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Activate payer</li>\n<li>Send an RTP via GPD message (CREATE VALID)</li>\n<li>Cancel the RTP via GPD message (DELETE) -&gt; RTP to RFC_SENT</li>\n<li>Send DS12N callback with CxlStsId RJCR (Rejected Cancellation Request) -&gt; RTP to ERROR_CANCEL</li>\n<li>Send the same DS12N RJCR callback again on the already transitioned RTP</li>\n<li>Verify the second callback is rejected (400) since the transition is no longer valid</li>\n<li>Verify RTP status remains ERROR_CANCEL</li>\n</ol>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_session_faker","time":{"start":1788416041061,"stop":1788416041129,"duration":68},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"stepsCount":0,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"rtp_consumer_access_token","time":{"start":1788416388948,"stop":17884163895